  "result": "All 8 tests pass, including the three new ones in tests/test_t2.py.\n\nWhat I changed, all in `ledger/ledger.py` (the existing snapshot-state design was kept):\n\n- **apply_interest(basis_points)** validates the rate as a non-negative int, then credits each positive balance with `balance * bp // 10000`. Integer floor division gives the required rounding down, and zero balances are skipped.\n- **close_account(id)** looks up the account, which raises the existing UnknownAccount error for unknown ids, raises ValueError if the balance is not zero, and otherwise deletes the entry so the id becomes unknown afterwards.\n- **total_assets()** returns the sum of all balances in the dict.\n\nNothing under `tests/` was touched. The new file and the changes are still uncommitted, matching the state I found the repo in.",
